1. Challenges & Streaks --done
Daily/Weekly Eco-Challenges (e.g., "Bike to work 3 times this week", "Save 5kg CO₂ this month").
Streak tracking → reward users who log carbon savings consistently for consecutive days.
Where to add: new schema (ChallengeSchema), service + endpoints to join/track challenges.

2. Eco Rewards Marketplace --done
Earn EcoPoints for carbon savings → redeem them in a reward marketplace.
Could be real rewards (partner discounts) or virtual perks (badges, titles, avatars).
Where to add: extend your achievements system, add points field in UserSchema.

3. Community Groups & Team Challenges ---done
Users can join groups (friends, workplaces, schools).
Compete as teams on the leaderboard.
Example: "Company A vs. Company B: Who saves more CO₂ this month?"
Where to add: new schema (GroupSchema), extend leaderboard to support team stats.

5. Social Sharing & Eco Profile --done
Each user gets a public Eco Profile (like a portfolio).
Allow sharing badges & achievements to Instagram, Twitter, or WhatsApp → drives organic growth.
Where to add: new controller endpoint for public profile, simple frontend view for shareable cards.
